	"system": {
		"description": "<p>At 19th level, your renown is such that you may be granted a title of true nobility or darkest legend. Choose between the following options.</p><p><strong>Noble Title:</strong> You gain a noble title which you will grant to your descendants or another you designate as an heir. You enjoy a rich lifestyle.</p><p><strong>Legend of Darkness:</strong> Your reputation of violence precedes you wherever you go. NPCs with a CR of half your level or less become cowering sycophants in your presence and have their attitude increased by two degrees unless you have directly harmed their interests.</p>",
